{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49657","headline":"木兰花 二 · 欧阳炯","name":"木兰花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日照玉楼花似锦，楼上醉和春色寝。\n绿杨风送小莺声，残梦不成离玉枕。\n堪爱晚来韶景甚，宝柱秦筝方再品。\n青蛾红脸笑来迎，又向海棠花下饮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}